        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin hang'da beashooda bea oormeeda gasa gwatuudu ea dea oomu ea dea areara ea dea bumbuni miy, ak ghwayiin geeruubajeega nea gadiyeeda sin gearnoocheanda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.35",
