          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin daranaji ang'wan bea rabeangheeda, ak gwadukuta aba dahaabu, eara gifungajeagaaschi gaba dahaabu, ak gwasissa saawa hoorgaji ang'wan bea gharinga sisina lapiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.36",
